// Where paragraph vwi_p's own top is on page vwi_k, in lu down the text area: 0 less the y of the line the page starts at when the paragraph carries on from the page before (so that line is at the top), else its top in the continuous document less the pages above it and the top margin.
view_flow_paragraph_base(View view_flow_base_view, int view_flow_base_page, int view_flow_base_paragraph) {
  int view_flow_base_first_line = view_flow_base_view.pages.starts[2 * view_flow_base_page + 1];
